s’ and ‘Wot’s… Uh The Deal’, as well as an exclusive full version of ‘Pigs On The Wing’, previously available on the 1977 Animals 8-Track cartridge release. Official Video for \"Wish You Were Here\" by Pink Floyd\n\nListen to Pink Floyd: https://PinkFloyd.lnk.to/listenID\nWatch more videos by Pink Floyd: https://PinkFloyd.lnk.to/listenID/youtube\nSubscribe on YouTube: https://PinkFloyd.lnk.to/subscribeID\n\nFollow Pink Floyd: \nhttps://PinkFloyd.lnk.to/_followII\nhttps://PinkFloyd.lnk.to/_followFI\nhttps://PinkFloyd.lnk.to/_followYx\nhttps://PinkFloyd.lnk.to/_followSI\nhttps://PinkFloyd.lnk.to/_followTI\n\nCredits:\nDirector & Lead Editor:  Justin Daashuur Hopkins\nProducer:  Dilly Gent\nEditor: Mark Harrison\nAssistant editor: Ru Storey\nProduction company: Son&Heir\n\nLyrics:\nAnd disciplinary remains mercifully\nYes and um, I'm with you Derek, this star nonsense\nYes, yes, now which is it?\nI am sure of it\n\nSo, so you think you can tell Heaven from Hell, blue skies from pain\nCan you tell a green field from a cold steel rail?\nA smile from a veil?\nDo you think you can tell?\n\nDid they get you to trade your heroes for ghosts?\nHot ashes for trees?\nHot air for a cool breeze?\nCold comfort for change?\nDid you exchange\nA walk-on part in the war for a lead role in a cage?\n\nHow I wish, how I wish you were here\nWe're just two lost souls swimming in a fishbowl, year after year\nRunning over the same old ground\nWhat have we found?\nThe same old fears\nWish you were here\n\n#PinkFloyd #OfficialVideo #WishYouWereHere", "channel_id": "UCY2qt3dw2TQJxvBrDiYGHdQ", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCY2qt3dw2TQJxvBrDiYGHdQ", "duration": 340, "view_count": 13727824, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K6qj09OHvjw", "categories": ["Music"], "tags": [], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "